    "tags": [
      "first principles",
      "thinking",
      "advice"
    ],
    "en": {
      "text": "Think from first principles. Question every assumption. That's how you find breakthroughs.",
      "context": "关于第一性原理思维的建议"
    },
    "zh": {
      "text": "从第一性原理思考。质疑每一个假设。这就是你找到突破的方法。",
      "context": "关于第一性原理思维的建议"
    },
    "style_markers": [
      "philosophical",
      "advisory",
      "deep"
    ],
    "quality_score": 0.94
  },
  {
    "id": "tweet_business-advice_007",
    "source": {
      "type": "tweet",
      "date": "2023-11-10",
      "engagement": {
        "likes": 320000,
        "retweets": 39000,
        "replies": 26000,
        "views": 77000000
      }
    },
    "category": "business-advice",
    "tags": [
      "feedback",
      "criticism",
      "growth"
    ],
    "en": {
      "text": "Ask your customers what they want, then build it. But also build what they don't know they want yet.",
      "context": "关于产品开发的建议"
    },
    "zh": {
      "text": "问你的客户他们想要什么，然后构建它。但也要构建他们还不知道自己想要的东西。",
      "context": "关于产品开发的建议"
    },
    "style_markers": [
      "advisory",
      "innovative",
      "business"
    ],
    "quality_score": 0.91
  },
  {
